    "text": "The upper and lower staircase, with a watercourse channel running along the side to soften the earth.  \n\nThe watercourse will eventually have a small pond at the top, and another small pond at the bottom, with trickling falls all along the way.\n\nThese are the benefits of self-imposed social isolation. So much fun, isn't it?",
